      "name": "Destructive Confirmation",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "button-destructive",
      "description": "In-menu confirmation that names the consequence before a destructive step.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-confirm\"><p>\"feature/x\" has commits that aren't merged into any other branch. Force deleting it leaves them reachable only through the reflog.</p><div class=\"ds-row\"><button class=\"ds-danger\">Force delete</button><button class=\"ds-plain\">Keep branch</button></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-confirm{width:250px;padding:8px 10px;background:var(--surface-overlay,#2e2e31);border:1px solid var(--border,#3c3c40);border-radius:6px;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.5);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-confirm p{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:11px;line-height:1.4;color:var(--danger,#ff7b72)}.ds-row{display:flex;gap:6px}.ds-danger,.ds-plain{flex:1;padding:4px 0;border:none;border-radius:4px;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer}.ds-danger{background:var(--danger-fill,#c42f2a);color:#fff;font-weight:600}.ds-danger:hover{background:var(--danger-fill-hover,#b02824)}.ds-plain{background:var(--surface-control,#38383c);color:var(--text-secondary,#c0c0c5)}.ds-plain:hover{background:var(--surface-control-hover,#424246)}"
    },
